access.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false}},"image_8dzBDy":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/11_b388603f-e6a2-4493-87bc-f28a258a38f0.jpg","icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Expandable Capacity","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"<p>The bag adjusts its thickness automatically based on what you carry. Carry just the essentials for a slim look, or expand effortlessly for extra room when needed, always keeping a sleek profile.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false}},"image_iahUVm":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/12_75fc6fd3-1185-4343-ab9b-57eee07b5d37.jpg","icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Magnetic Quick-Release Strap","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"<p>The detachable shoulder strap features a magnetic buckle at the center, allowing you to remove or attach the bag instantly.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false}}},"block_order":["image_4V943C","image_8dzBDy","image_iahUVm"],"custom_css":["@media (max-width: 768px) {.image-with-text {flex-direction: column; } .image-with-text__image {width: 100%; margin-bottom: 36px; } .image-with-text__content {width: 100%; margin-top: 0; }}"],"name":"t:sections.scrolling-banner.name","settings":{"image_height":"adapt","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"items-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"faq_e8YgDp":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_xBTdaC":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What makes the Urban UL2 different from other sling bags?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The Urban UL2 features a smart triple-compartment layout, expandable storage, a hidden anti-theft back pocket, and a magnetic quick-release buckle. It keeps essentials organized, secure, and easy to access while maintaining a slim profile.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_Uncqbd":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>How does the expandable design work?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The pleated side panels expand naturally as you add items, giving you extra carrying capacity when needed while keeping the bag slim when carrying fewer essentials.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_zdPF3w":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Urban UL2 waterproof?<\/strong>","text":"<p>No,The Urban UL2 is made from water-resistant ripstop nylon and features water-repellent SBS zippers. It protects your essentials from light rain and daily urban conditions.Does not offer full waterproof protection<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_64XxVk":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What are the three compartments used for?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The front compartment stores quick-access essentials, the main compartment organizes larger items such as a tablet or gaming device, and the hidden rear pocket secures valuables like your passport, cash, or phone.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_bYbxQr":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Choose UL2 or UL1?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Choose <a href=\"\/products\/urban-ul2-sling-bag-black\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban UL2 Sling Bag-Black\">UL2<\/a> for the smaller profile and side-pleat flexibility. <br\/>Choose <a href=\"https:\/\/nayosmart.com\/products\/urban-ul1-sling-bag\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/nayosmart.com\/products\/urban-ul1-sling-bag\">UL1<\/a> for more capacity and camera-focused organization.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_JAgYeB":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Can it carry a water bottle or umbrella?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The gap between compartments can hold a 500ml mineral water bottle and an umbrella about 25cm long.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_UXfP9A":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What occasions is the Urban UL2 best for?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Urban UL2 is perfect for everyday carry (EDC), commuting, city travel, weekend outings, walking, cycling, shopping, and minimalist travel where you only need the essentials close at hand.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["question_xBTdaC","question_Uncqbd","question_zdPF3w","question_64XxVk","question_bYbxQr","question_JAgYeB","question_UXfP9A"],"name":"t:sections.faq.name","settings":{"style":"with-background","heading":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false,"color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity"